# Variant & Shell Rules

**Full detail:** [docs/ai/08-feature-variant-shell.md](../../docs/ai/08-feature-variant-shell.md)

## Scope

- `variantscreen` — loads JSON pages, orchestrates cubits + `ScreenRenderer`
- `shell` — `TabShellWidget` bottom navigation

## Must

- Load pages via `AssetVariantRepository` (same variantId as `MobileAppConfig`)
- Use `EngineRequestMapper.collectRequests` before cubit loads
- Populate `dataContext.requests.{requestKey}` for itemBuilder sources
- Keep domain fetches in cubits — this file only orchestrates

## Key files

- `variant_repository.dart` — parse builder JSON → `ScreenConfig`
- `variant_screen.dart` — integration hub (~900 lines)
- `variant_cubit.dart` — load states
- `tab_shell_widget.dart` — tabs from `NavigationConfig`

## Must not

- Duplicate JSON parsing outside `variant_repository.dart`
- Add standalone `GoRoute` to custom widgets for routes already in JSON

## Debugging

Blank UI: check route in `pages[]`, `requestUrl` pattern, cubit error state, renderer `unsupported` fallback
